{"capturado_en": "2026-11-17T18:26:25+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vanakatu", "steam_appid": 2967590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967590/extras/575aecced89eb3601828493909c181c0.avif?t=1794055524\" width=616 height=154 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISCLAIMER: I completed this video game for my capstone project in university - it's my first video game project ever so it's pretty buggy, but I'm still proud enough of the work I put into it to showcase it publicly. To make it fair for everyone, I decided to make the game free to play, but if you would like to support me, you can find my Instagram here - @pixie.eats.people, where you can DM me/ donate to me!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an open-world story about VAN CAT (that's his name, no affiliations with vehicles), a duduk player from a regular family, who tracks down his CULT-LEADING UNCLE to talk him out of creating a WORLDWIDE DICTATORSHIP!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Game Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique visuals by the developer herself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beautiful music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Guitar Hero inspired battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzle solving - using pattern recognition to unlock doors and find hidden keys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A duduk!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967590/extras/f8db9d10d3f47d059ac579893c11afd8.avif?t=1794055524\" width=616 height=155 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s